        "abstract": "Artificial intelligence (AI) augmentation is rapidly becoming the reigning idea for promoting a human-centric coevolution of people and AI. It represents a shift in mindset from the idea of people accommodating to work automation to the idea of technology purposefully augmenting important behavioral qualities, such as curiosity, creativity, and courage, in entirely new ways. Despite the notion’s popularity, however, practical action strategies remain scarce, let alone for leading AI-augmented digital transformations. This article presents a research-based approach to purposefully direct digital transformation leaders’ efforts toward AI augmentation.",
